OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792707509
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AZuckerberg wins Meta deal to help him
OL,4,Afoot bill for possible California
OL,5,Abillionaire tax
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe measure would impose a one-time 5%
OL,8,Ftax on residents with a net worth of
OL,9,Fmore than $1bn. It would likely see the
OL,10,FFacebook co-founder pay around $10bn in
OL,11,Fadditional state taxes.
OL,13,FHe secured the deal with a special
OL,14,Fcommittee of Meta after "robust" and
OL,15,F"at several points, contentious"
OL,16,Fnegotiations, according to a Wednesday
OL,17,Ffinancial disclosure.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
