CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792707509
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump ordered to answer questions under
OL,4,Aoath in BBC lawsuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharles Tobin, a lawyer representing
OL,7,Fthe BBC, said in court that "we still
OL,8,Fhaven't been able to depose the
OL,9,Fplaintiff" with two months left in the
OL,10,Fdiscovery period, during which both
OL,11,Fsides are legally required to exchange
OL,12,Finformation with each other on their
OL,13,Fcase.
OL,15,FTrump cancelled a previous deposition
OL,16,Fon 16 October, citing "matters of
OL,17,Fnational importance" while he was
OL,18,Fcampaigning in Georgia.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
