OL,3,APolice investigate Married at First
OL,4,ASight Australia after 'inappropriate'
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarried at First Sight Australia is
OL,8,Ffacing fresh controversy after police
OL,9,Flaunched an investigation into the hit
OL,10,Freality TV show.
OL,12,FNew South Wales Police told BBC News
OL,13,Fthat inquiries had taken place
OL,14,F"following a report of inappropriate
OL,15,Fcontent being shared".
OL,17,FChannel Nine, which broadcasts Married
OL,18,Fat First Sight Australia, confirmed
OL,19,Fthat it was "aware of a police
OL,20,Finvestigation" involving the show's
OL,21,Fproduction company.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
